      "text": "Both models are open today: the weights and the engine.\n\n⛰️ Edge0-145B: flagship — 86.5 on Terminal-Bench 2.1\n🪶 Edge0-120B: lighter version\n\nRuns on your laptop or desktop. Serves an OpenAI- and Anthropic-compatible API, so you can point your coding agent at localhost and keep",
      "url": "https://x.com/SamuelZengML/status/2120940287887622146"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "886311068",
      "created_at": "2026-11-12T18:02:21.000Z",
