        }
      ],
      "text": "How do we run a 145B model on a laptop or consumer GPU?\n\nThe short answer: we don't keep all 145B parameters on the GPU at once.\n\nEdge0-145B is a sparse MoE model with 512 experts per layer. Only 10 are activated for each token, which works out to roughly 6.6B active parameters. https://t.co/wrjrFIAAao",
      "url": "https://x.com/SamuelZengML/status/2120940275069780234"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "886311068",
      "created_at": "2026-11-12T18:02:16.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2120940254962258268"
