          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Local vibe coding #4: PCB design\n\nThis time we gave Edge0-145B a different task: design a circuit board, then animate how it gets made.\n\nIt placed the components and routed both layers in KiCad, brought the board into Unreal Engine 5, set up the cameras and lighting, and rendered https://t.co/80DavuuhA7",
      "url": "https://x.com/SamuelZengML/status/2120940254962258268"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "2096444031370924032",
      "created_at": "2026-11-12T18:01:27.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2120940049391100394"
