        {
          "id": "2120939739431972922",
          "type": "quoted"
        }
      ],
      "text": "A major turning point for our crew.\n\nFrontier-level agentic coding, now running fully on-device. Edge0-145B and Edge0-120B are available with open weights.\n\nGive them a try. https://t.co/PUz1LkImYb",
      "url": "https://x.com/Edge0_AI/status/2120940049391100394"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "886311068",
      "created_at": "2026-11-12T18:01:21.000Z",
