          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Local vibe coding #3: video production\n\nCan a flying Roadster actually work? We gave Edge0-145B one prompt to find out.\n\nIt worked through the physics, wrote a script, recreated the car in 3D, and put together a 94-second explainer.\n\nAll on a laptop, without calling a cloud https://t.co/JkViCdNriH",
      "url": "https://x.com/SamuelZengML/status/2120940024925688212"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "886311068",
      "created_at": "2026-11-12T18:00:54.000Z",
