      ],
      "text": "Local vibe coding #2: game worlds\n\nOne prompt, five reference images, and no internet.\n\nWe asked Edge0-145B to build a medieval city for a fantasy RPG.\n\nIt built the whole thing from scratch: red-tiled roofs, a market square, a Gothic cathedral with twin towers, and even a https://t.co/oO5QqDA4mc",
      "url": "https://x.com/SamuelZengML/status/2120939910911955139"
    },
    {
